<title>USA: Alpharma Animal Health opens Brazil unit.</title>
<headline>Alpharma Animal Health opens Brazil unit.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LEE, N.J. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpharma Inc said Tuesday that its Animal Health Division has established a new subsidiary, Alpharma do Brasil Ltda, located outside Sao Paulo, Brazil.</p>
<p>Alpharma said it opened the new unit to meet growing demand for its line of animal health feed additives, including Albac, BMD, and 3-Nitro.</p>
</text>
